XM2 buf_stage_1 in gd gd sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XM3 out buf_stage_1 vph vph sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
